Amanye amafulegi ozama ukuwangenisa asevele anamanani amisiwe. Ungathanda ukubhala phezu kwamanani abo amanje ngalawa achazwe ekungenisweni?

Kukhona {0} izincazelo zefulege ezingqubuzanayo:
{1}

I- JSON oyifakile ibonakala ingavumelekile. Sicela uyihlole kabili bese uzama futhi.

Ulwazi olwengeziwe:
{0}

Ifolda okhethe ukuyifaka i- Voidstrap isivele ikhona futhi AYINAlutho. Kunconywa kakhulu ukuthi i- Voidstrap ifakwe kufolda yayo ezimele.
Ukushintshela endaweni elandelayo kuyaphakanyiswa: {0}
Ungathanda ukushintshela endaweni ephakanyisiwe? I- Ukukhetha okuthi 'Cha' kuzoziba lesi sexwayiso futhi kuqhubeke nokufaka.

Vula i- Voidstrap mod "{0}"? Amamodeli we-

{1}

 Voidstrap angashintsha indlela i- Voidstrap esebenza ngayo futhi aguqule izilungiselelo zayo. Vula kuphela amamodeli owethembayo.

Faka "{0}" {1} ngo @{2}? I-

{3}

Voidstrap ihlola wonke ifayela ngokuqhathanisa nelabhulali ngaphambi kokuyifaka, futhi ibuze ngaphambi kokuvula i-mod.

Le mod ithatha indawo yamafayela amanye ama-mod anikwe amandla nawo athatha indawo yawo:

{0}

Amamodi agqagqene angenza i- Roblox ibukeke noma iziphathe ngendlela eyinqaba, kodwa lokhu akukwazi ukuphahlazeka Voidstrap. Vala eyodwa yazo uma kukhona okungalungile.
